    // We want to minimize the post_residual, so it is already the base.

    // 2. Harmonic/Modulo Logic:
    // If post_residual is small, it might be "stranded" space that cannot fit future items.
    // If post_residual is in the range [1, 9], it is highly likely to be wasted.
    if post_residual > 0 && post_residual < 10 {
